<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian federal forces have installed a caretaker administration in Tigray and are moving toward the Eritrean border, while a pro-government militia says it seized the regional airport and reports Eritrean forces suffered losses there. The United States, through Secretary of State Marco Rubio, is urging Ethiopia and Eritrea to de-escalate the fighting, and Mekelle mayor Shishay Amare announced elections within six months to resolve Western Tigray through constitutional processes. A drone strike in the disputed Abyei region killed at least 73 people, and the conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPcTJMaFBua2FpcHRaaE5TVkZKM29mVGpyVDR6cFJsclN5WFJYNFpQU2EwSWprNkJoYUJ5U0I3NElFM2tBdzBiTGVrOTRuZ19kOVVQeG1fcl9RSHIxTFplYWc2MnFsMmxVWWM2SHdHdjFFUnNJZDJQV0dyY1dhUURIWnFEMzJVWEZtU1JoSVNVTEZxYlVKNWhFaXZCTXUweVpOcnJ5cGp1Vjc0SXE2S2l0a1Zla1NkdTQy0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1RUFdsVUFQcUVWZlMyM18ySlNZR3dWVExOc05LTFVpWDhWNnh6ZWx6cFdFRGtJQ0ttT2V5NXgzR0dwSWZWQ25HV1dkdEpJUnQzeGFQTEs4UFVPTi15bjVUOFhKaldMVjhtVjBYcXdSdEdLN1FGSUNTUURsdHlUVW5zNVRNTVJKOHpzbnNTbmgxTzRTZ2tSRXItbzJWTkxMNENrY2F0ZUEtSnlxbS0tU05ZOHFBWTVuRkI3Wk1Pb2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOQjlhY3hwdWpvQ2I1Z0x4NHF4aFhtc1Y5UFZyblAxXzJ1dWg5SlpaLU9FMVdnYW12aUFNMF9MVWZFYlpWNm04U0JiVm94NVQyeU5mMGZ1d0NZb2ZaMGlvSGd2MTJBQktyY3hZME5MQ0FNTXdPcWtac1NEeU1vZjUwMGVFcTg2Y1Jsc3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Tanzania Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNNkdJNThpNWphRHZvX3dROGg0NmpoaUJLS2NoSm42c3o0aUd3eTh6M3ktQnNjc3p3THZRX2FlUVlTdjlXQWZoZWdxZGYwekt2dWl3T0VRcmpmeDhfOWZQcjZkc2xxS3BmaDNjaEhXSTdYaW1IOHNxdGtPT3QyckFOV2U3bF92TXhFREJva2Z3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borkena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: